  ('6e80ceb7-cfbf-4c13-9f63-ef2ef7e73bf0','NAAVAK, based in Concord in the East Bay of the San Francisco Bay Area, is a USA Archery affiliated club running Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD), an Adult Archery Program, Olympic Archery in the Schools, and lessons. Running Olympic Archery in the Schools alongside JOAD suggests a real pipeline from a first classroom introduction to structured club-level development, a notably complete setup for a suburban Bay Area club. Contra Costa County has plenty of families looking for structured youth activities, and lessons on top of that pipeline lower the barrier for someone with zero background. Specific schedules and pricing aren''t listed, so reaching out directly is the way to get current information.'),
